      propertyPath: noteBody
      value: 'I fixed the lift temporarily, however it seems as though there is problem
        which causes the fuses to die but it should be working for a little while.


        Unfortunately
        I will be gone for a while so if it breaks again you will have to fix it
        yourself. I left a guide for you in your office.


        I know that little
        tasks like this are hard for you but i think you should be able to repair
        it yourself if it breaks again.


        I will fix it completely once I
        am back. '
